<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-SEMIFINAL RESULTS IN LEIPZIG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SEMIFINAL RESULTS IN LEIPZIG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results from $450,000</p>
<p>women's tournament in Leipzig (Prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) 7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>4-Anke Huber (Germany) beat 1-Steffi Graf (Germany) - walkover,</p>
<p>Graf withdrew due to injury.</p>
</text>
